Subject: [PATCH] Stage 3: shared world state (time, doors, item pickup/drop)
 with relay-side change log

- worldsync.lua: content-file-stable object ids, deferred application for unloaded objects
- relay: records doors/takes/drops/time, replays to late joiners, elects a host for time authority
- block activation of remote-player stand-in NPCs

